<title>USA: Morrison Knudsen wins part of contract.</title>
<headline>Morrison Knudsen wins part of contract.</headline>
<dateline>BOISE, Idaho 1997-08-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Morrison Knudsen Corp Wednesday said it was part of an integrated team led by The Babcock and Wilcox Co. that will provide management services at the U.S. Department of Energy's Mound nuclear facility  near Miamisburg, Ohio.</p>
<p>The total contract value of the combined team effort is estimated to be $425 million over the next 5-1/3 years.</p>
<p>Work is scheduled to begin October 1, 1997, after a 45-day contract transition period.</p>
